 "multiple_tracks": {
  "rule": "TransformController (Heck/Animation/Transform/TransformController.cs): with several tracks, position and localPosition are summed, scale multiplied per component, rotation and localRotation multiplied as quaternions in track order; a property no track sets stays unset; localPosition wins over position and localRotation over rotation; v2 positions are multiplied by 0.6.",
